WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.000
T-this is...

00:22.870 --> 00:24.910
I lost again.

00:27.280 --> 00:28.950
Oh, we meet again.

00:28.950 --> 00:30.460
What are you doing?

00:31.620 --> 00:33.080
You're going to sleep already?

00:33.080 --> 00:37.070
I see. It isn't healthy to stay up late.

00:39.760 --> 00:42.600
Well then, I'll sleep with you!

00:44.780 --> 00:46.310
Just wait a little, okay?

00:53.200 --> 00:54.670
You can't look!

00:56.100 --> 00:57.010
Thanks for waiting.

00:57.550 --> 00:58.160
The alarm clock!

00:58.900 --> 01:00.330
Now we're good.

01:01.610 --> 01:03.780
Okay, sorry to keep you waiting!

01:03.780 --> 01:05.070
And now...

01:05.500 --> 01:07.610
Good night.

01:30.000 --> 01:33.880
I'm kind of happy that we're sleeping together so my voice suddenly came out.

01:43.110 --> 01:45.160
This is kind of embarrassing.

01:49.440 --> 01:52.160
This really is kind of embarrassing.

02:11.870 --> 02:13.650
That tickles!

03:23.660 --> 03:29.890
Um... well... um...

03:31.670 --> 03:35.330
Um... is it all right... if I hold your hand?

03:37.370 --> 03:38.850
Oh, it's okay?

03:38.850 --> 03:39.990
Yay.

03:45.970 --> 03:48.710
Holding hands is relaxing, isn't it?

04:04.750 --> 04:08.000
I think I'm getting sleepy.

26:02.180 --> 26:06.300
Eh? You like me?

26:06.300 --> 26:08.320
Eh? That's, that's...

26:08.320 --> 26:09.860
R-really?

26:09.860 --> 26:12.030
The truth is

26:12.030 --> 26:13.090
I like you, too!

27:15.050 --> 27:17.630
What? You can't sleep?

27:19.440 --> 27:22.610
Then I'll sing a lullaby to you.

27:25.790 --> 27:30.120
Go to sleep, go to sleep.

27:31.030 --> 27:34.600
On Hinako's chest.

27:34.600 --> 27:35.630
Come,

27:36.230 --> 27:40.800
Go to sleep, go to sleep.

27:41.590 --> 27:45.100
In Hinako's hands.

27:46.880 --> 27:51.380
Your heart's hope

27:52.090 --> 27:55.460
is in the song's voice.

27:55.910 --> 27:57.070
Come,

27:57.610 --> 28:02.070
Swirling, floating.

28:02.710 --> 28:06.160
It's a fun ole dream.

28:07.680 --> 28:12.250
Go to sleep, go to sleep.

28:12.780 --> 28:16.410
On Hinako's chest.

28:16.410 --> 28:17.670
Come,

28:18.170 --> 28:22.760
Go to sleep, go to sleep.

28:23.460 --> 28:27.130
In Hinako's hands.

28:33.700 --> 28:38.400
He's so warm.

28:38.400 --> 28:42.450
This young man.

28:44.190 --> 28:48.580
Getting... sleepier.

28:49.440 --> 28:55.170
Go... to... sleep.

28:56.170 --> 28:59.100
Go... to...

29:15.640 --> 29:16.100
All right!

29:32.300 --> 29:33.220
This is...

29:35.300 --> 29:37.060
I did it!

29:37.440 --> 29:39.290
I didn't eat any snacks.

29:39.290 --> 29:42.250
You won't grow big and strong like me if you don't keep it up!

30:31.380 --> 30:34.440
What do you think of me?

30:34.440 --> 30:35.790
Do you like me?

30:38.450 --> 30:39.820
Yay.

30:39.820 --> 30:42.990
Me too, I like you as well.

30:44.190 --> 30:46.450
Umm, well...

30:46.450 --> 30:48.830
Like lovers,

30:49.550 --> 30:52.200
let's kiss.

31:06.250 --> 31:08.030
We did it didn't we?

31:11.950 --> 31:15.350
We kissed!

32:42.630 --> 32:45.250
For some reason, I'm wide awake.

32:46.720 --> 32:49.540
Since I might not fall asleep for a while,

32:49.540 --> 32:52.320
is it all right to look at you for a bit?

33:12.110 --> 33:15.480
Hey, hey. Come sleep next to me.

34:05.210 --> 34:08.650
I'm starting to get sleepy.

34:37.710 --> 34:40.280
Did I fall asleep?

34:46.740 --> 34:49.900
Sorry, I'm going to go to sleep ahead of you.

34:50.770 --> 34:55.820
Let's meet again in the morning, okay?

35:29.550 --> 35:31.870
Eh! A ghost?!

35:34.550 --> 35:38.190
Jeez, I thought you were a ghost.

35:38.190 --> 35:40.030
Ahh, that was frightening.

35:40.860 --> 35:43.320
What am I doing, you ask?

35:45.940 --> 35:47.220
This is...

35:47.220 --> 35:50.210
Umm... It's...

35:50.590 --> 35:52.520
I'm sorry!

35:52.520 --> 35:55.540
No matter how much I exercise, I can't be doing this.

35:55.540 --> 35:56.570
I'm sorry.

35:56.570 --> 35:58.210
From now on, I'll be careful.

36:05.660 --> 36:08.760
Brushing your teeth is important right?

36:15.570 --> 36:16.670
Sorry for the wait.

36:17.030 --> 36:18.780
Now, shall we sleep?

36:22.400 --> 36:24.080
Good night.

36:57.950 --> 37:01.170
Hm? You're still awake?

37:04.820 --> 37:08.820
Staying awake is bad for you, got it?

37:12.550 --> 37:14.110
Then let's sleep.

37:15.410 --> 37:20.110
It's bad if you don't sleep properly, got it?

37:44.460 --> 37:45.420
All right!

38:04.590 --> 38:06.720
I gained weight!

38:07.470 --> 38:10.100
I did so much to be healthy!

38:10.800 --> 38:11.620
Why?!

38:12.590 --> 38:14.670
Ah! That's right.

38:14.670 --> 38:17.620
Afterwards, I ate too many snacks.

38:21.410 --> 38:26.650
I'm so stupid!

39:39.880 --> 39:40.990
It's morning isn't it?

39:40.990 --> 39:41.850
Good morning.

39:42.290 --> 39:43.780
Did you sleep well?

39:44.450 --> 39:45.900
I slept perfectly fine.

39:57.690 --> 40:00.050
Of course the morning feels great!

40:04.780 --> 40:08.330
Wouldn't it be nice to spend all day together today?

40:09.680 --> 40:12.940
Well, I'm going to get ready but...

40:12.940 --> 40:15.940
Um, well, you see...

40:15.940 --> 40:19.870
If you'd like, I would be happy if you came to see me again tonight.

40:19.870 --> 40:22.830
Somehow, if you could make it, it'd be great!

40:24.160 --> 40:26.080
Let's sleep together again okay?

40:26.100 --> 40:28.150
Okay, then. Bye bye.

41:10.950 --> 41:13.250
Mm? You're still sleeping?

41:14.030 --> 41:15.250
Good morning.

41:15.250 --> 41:16.850
It's morning!

41:16.850 --> 41:18.550
Come on. Wake up.

41:21.520 --> 41:23.880
It's morning.

41:26.070 --> 41:28.830
Geez, It's morning!

41:30.240 --> 41:32.840
Hey! Wake up!

41:35.940 --> 41:37.700
Wake up!

41:38.380 --> 41:40.410
Wake up.

41:51.270 --> 41:53.280
Yeah, that did it.

41:55.590 --> 41:58.500
Come on, if you don't wake up, I'll do it again!

42:02.580 --> 42:06.240
I have to get ready so make sure to get up okay?

42:06.840 --> 42:10.910
If you fall asleep again, you'll regret it okay?

42:10.910 --> 42:14.580
Since I fell asleep again so many times, I should know.

42:15.680 --> 42:17.180
Do you feel like getting up now?

42:18.420 --> 42:21.310
But, as expected sleeping together...

42:21.850 --> 42:23.800
was kind of nice, wasn't it?

42:25.310 --> 42:27.540
Hey! Are you listening to me?

42:31.840 --> 42:35.150
Then, I look forward to our next meeting.

42:35.630 --> 42:36.570
Bye bye.

43:12.580 --> 43:13.520
It's morning?

43:14.430 --> 43:15.680
Good morning.

43:15.680 --> 43:17.920
Seems like the morning comes so quickly.

43:18.320 --> 43:20.080
I still want to sleep.

43:30.160 --> 43:34.310
Hey, why don't we sleep together for the whole day?

43:35.380 --> 43:36.320
No good?

43:37.170 --> 43:39.490
I see, you're right.

43:40.070 --> 43:42.330
You have things to do right?

43:43.130 --> 43:47.600
Ah! It's because I'd get yelled at if I skipped work?

43:48.580 --> 43:50.950
Come on, you're so nice.

43:50.950 --> 43:53.060
Then shall we both get up?

43:59.350 --> 44:04.640
Um... if I tell people we slept together, do you think they'd get the wrong idea?

44:05.650 --> 44:08.300
Later I'm going to try telling my senpai.

44:09.910 --> 44:12.570
Eh? It's best not to say?

44:14.020 --> 44:15.230
You're right.

44:15.230 --> 44:17.570
It's better to keep it a secret between us.

44:19.260 --> 44:20.480
Come now!

44:20.480 --> 44:22.630
Why are you getting all red!

44:22.630 --> 44:26.020
Even I'm getting embarrassed now!

44:28.130 --> 44:31.270
Well then, come tonight for sure okay?

44:33.180 --> 44:35.450
Eh? Why?

44:35.450 --> 44:38.810
Please come, geeeeeeez!

44:39.890 --> 44:41.690
Really? That's great!

44:43.770 --> 44:46.600
Geez, you're so mean!

44:49.160 --> 44:51.600
Then let's meet tonight okay?
